WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.698
A forest carbon project promises decades of storage.

00:00:03.698 --> 00:00:06.466
Too often it is verified once, and paid once.

00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:13.047
If the trees burn in year two, nothing in the payment reacts, and nobody who vouched for them pays a price.

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.846
Proof of Canopy changes when the money moves.

00:00:16.846 --> 00:00:24.528
Funding sits in escrow and is released one year at a time, in proportion to how much of the original canopy Sentinel-2 can still see.

00:00:24.528 --> 00:00:27.993
At or below seventy percent, that year's money stays frozen.

00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:33.134
Every survival claim is staked by the verifier who makes it, and anyone can challenge it.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:38.645
These are three real 250-hectare plots, measured the same way.

00:00:38.645 --> 00:00:41.078
Yedigöller, in Türkiye, is healthy.

00:00:41.078 --> 00:00:44.345
Novo Progresso, in Brazil, is slowly degrading.

00:00:44.345 --> 00:00:47.196
And Manavgat burned in the 2021 wildfire.

00:00:47.196 --> 00:00:55.052
Seven years of monthly Sentinel-2 data show the canopy collapse in August 2021, confirmed three independent ways:

00:00:55.052 --> 00:00:57.485
the canopy drop, a burn index of 0.

00:00:57.485 --> 00:01:01.170
33, and fifteen NASA fire detections inside the plot.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:04.785
The shrubs that grew back never reach the threshold.

00:01:05.985 --> 00:01:07.525
Satellites get fooled too.

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:13.802
In the Amazon fire season, smoke makes this plot look bare for a month, while the burn index barely moves.

00:01:13.802 --> 00:01:17.829
So each year is scored on its greenest month from August to October.

00:01:17.829 --> 00:01:22.625
Smoke and cloud only ever lower the reading; real canopy loss lowers every month.

00:01:23.825 --> 00:01:26.522
Everything from here is live on Base Sepolia.

00:01:26.522 --> 00:01:28.800
A developer registers the three plots.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:32.515
Try to register the same land again, and the contract refuses.

00:01:32.515 --> 00:01:40.127
Shift the boundary fifteen metres, so its fingerprint changes, and it still refuses, because the map cells are already claimed.

00:01:40.127 --> 00:01:43.303
Then a funder locks money in escrow for each project.

00:01:44.503 --> 00:01:50.881
A verifier stakes and submits five years for every plot, each with the hash of the evidence file it relies on.

00:01:50.881 --> 00:01:53.316
The challenge window passes, sped up here.

00:01:53.316 --> 00:01:55.287
Then each year settles on its own.

00:01:55.287 --> 00:01:57.259
The healthy forest gets its money.

00:01:57.259 --> 00:01:59.230
The degrading one gets part of it.

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:00.853
The burned one gets nothing:

00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:02.187
its money stays frozen.

00:02:02.187 --> 00:02:06.071
The website rebuilds all of this from contract events as they land.

00:02:07.271 --> 00:02:12.015
Now a second verifier lies, and claims the burned forest recovered to 94 percent.

00:02:12.015 --> 00:02:15.411
Unchallenged, that would pay for trees that are not there.

00:02:15.411 --> 00:02:19.159
The funder challenges with the honest evidence and posts a bond.

00:02:19.159 --> 00:02:21.150
The arbiter upholds the challenge.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:24.957
The liar's stake is slashed, half to the challenger, half burned.

00:02:24.957 --> 00:02:29.056
Nothing is released for the lie, and the honest claim takes its place.

00:02:30.256 --> 00:02:32.606
And you don't have to trust any of us.

00:02:32.606 --> 00:02:37.490
The Verify page fetches the liar's evidence file and hashes it in your browser.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:41.262
It matches the chain, so the file is exactly what was staked.

00:02:41.262 --> 00:02:46.394
Then it reruns the measurement on the satellite series, with the oracle's own code.

00:02:46.394 --> 00:02:47.445
The answer is 14.

00:02:47.445 --> 00:02:48.619
49 percent, not 94.

00:02:48.619 --> 00:02:51.463
A matching hash proves the file wasn't edited.

00:02:51.463 --> 00:02:53.751
Recomputing shows whether it is true.

00:02:54.951 --> 00:03:01.188
When every year is settled, the funder takes back what the canopy did not earn, and the developer withdraws what it did.

00:03:02.388 --> 00:03:05.948
The measurement stays off chain, where anyone can rerun it.

00:03:05.948 --> 00:03:08.906
The chain holds what no single party should hold:

00:03:08.906 --> 00:03:13.734
the plot's identity, the money, and a public, staked record of who claimed what.

00:03:13.734 --> 00:03:15.183
It doesn't trust anyone.

00:03:15.183 --> 00:03:16.692
It makes lying expensive.

00:03:17.892 --> 00:03:19.777
We measure canopy, not carbon:

00:03:19.777 --> 00:03:23.234
proof, year after year, that the trees are still there.
